      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: People can take the models just as easily no matter what they implement, really. It's like having two doors but only locking your front door. People can just go in the back. There is zero way to stop model stealing entirely. People will steal them regardless of what you implement. I've heard people literally going to the levels of running games in a virtual machine in order to rip the models and get around anticheat.\n\nThe most VRC can do is add anticheat and encrypt their files better. Models will still get stolen it'll just need a lot more effort for people to do it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
