  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-30T12:55:18.487Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I miss the public hub greatly, and i do believe that we should be given the option in the menu to spawn in the hub like it used to except allow people to opt in or out since im aware people don't want to because either they are afraid of avatar stealers or script kiddies, or they are just that antisocial.\n\ni do believe the hub was a great place to spawn given its issue in the past of avatar stealing n such because of being able to start the game with others in the same spot, it gave a feeling that i will never have again. i miss it dearly and i think other would love that option to come back like i do. i would kill for the option to spawn in a public instance of the old old hub, new old hub or the newest hub as a actual game feature and not a id code i put into steam launcher as this is way more accessible. thank you whatever dev takes there time to read this, i appreciate it!",
